damaged_code:
```
// Storing column mappings dynamically as in-memory metadata arrays
struct ColumnMap {
    column_name: String,
    field_name: String,
    data_type: String,
}

struct DataMap {
    table_name: String,
    columns: Vec<ColumnMap>,
}

fn load_row_via_metadata(map: &DataMap, row: &mysql::Row) -> HashMap<String, String> {
    let mut obj = HashMap::new();
    for col in &map.columns {
        let value: String = row.get(&col.column_name[..]).unwrap();
        obj.insert(col.field_name.clone(), value);
    }
    obj
}
```

fix:
Compile mapping structs directly to SQL bindings using compile-time checked mappers.

```
// Compile-time verified mapping structure
#[derive(sqlx::FromRow)]
struct Person {
    id: i64,
    first_name: String,
    last_name: String,
}
